OL,3,AEight killed and 18 missing after ferry
OL,4,Acapsizes off northern Cyprus
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least eight people have died and 18
OL,7,Fothers are still missing after a
OL,8,Fpassenger boat capsized off northern
OL,9,FCyprus, the head of the Turkish
OL,10,Fadministration there has said.
OL,12,FUnal Ustel, prime minister of the
OL,13,Fself-proclaimed Turkish republic on
OL,14,FCyprus, said the ferry had been
OL,15,Fcarrying 259 passengers and eight crew
OL,16,Fmembers when it began taking on water
OL,17,Fafter departing the coastal town of
OL,18,FKyrenia on Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
